/**
 * ICON. Simple line glyphs (24 grid, currentColor stroke) for the template's
 * circle-icon slots. Decorative: always aria-hidden.
 *
 * BRAND MARKS are the exception: a brand's logo is the brand's own artwork and may not be
 * approximated by hand. Those live in SOLID (filled, 24 grid, currentColor fill, no stroke) and
 * are rendered as supplied. OPERATOR REVIEW 6 (25 Nov 2026): "use the actual official WhatsApp
 * logo, not a hand-drawn/recreated approximation" - round 4's hand-drawn bubble-and-handset is
 * gone and the official WhatsApp glyph is in its place.
 */
